@startuml
' ============================================================
' UC-02: Deposit Funds - Sequence Diagram
' ============================================================

title UC-02: Deposit Funds

actor User
participant "Wallet UI" as UI
participant "Wallet API" as API
database "Wallet DB" as DB
participant "Payment Gateway" as PG
participant "LOG Service" as LOG

== Deposit Funds ==

User -> UI: Select deposit method & enter amount
UI -> API: POST /wallet/deposit { amount, method }
API -> API: Validate amount (min/max limits)
API -> DB: INSERT wallet_transactions (status: pending)
DB --> API: Transaction created

API -> PG: Initiate payment { amount, method }
PG --> API: Payment URL / redirect

API --> UI: 200 OK { payment_url }
UI --> User: Redirect to Payment Gateway

== Payment Processing ==

User -> PG: Complete payment
PG -> API: POST /webhooks/payment/callback { status, transaction_id }
API -> DB: UPDATE wallet_transactions SET status = 'completed'
API -> DB: UPDATE wallet_wallets SET balance = balance + amount
API -> LOG: Log deposit event
LOG --> API: Logged

API --> PG: 200 OK
PG --> User: Payment successful

@enduml